{ "timestamp":"2026-06-05T23:52:29Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"kaw2s", "Message":"Going to do my assignments tonight and then go wherever the PP is needed.", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2026-06-05T23:53:04Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"nue2y", "Message":"pps are needed everywhere, all over the place", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2026-06-05T23:53:16Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"nue2y", "Message":"i mean powerplay :D", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2026-06-05T23:53:35Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"bapyr", "Message":"Out in Colonia doing bounty hunting, It's real pretty out here. ", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2026-06-06T00:02:20Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"kaw2s", "Message":"Colonia is still too far away for me. -_-", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2026-06-06T00:03:32Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"nue2y", "Message":"might be taking my carrier there in the near future with a friend or two. we're still talking about how to plan it out, you could tag along, the jumps will most likely be consistent", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2026-06-06T00:03:56Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"nue2y", "Message":"although, you should unlock connecting engineers for colonia, otherwise youre half-wasting the trips", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2026-06-06T00:05:49Z", "event":"SendText", "To":"squadron", "Message":"you wanna take an FC to Colonia? That sounds like a lot of time.", "Sent":true }
{ "timestamp":"2026-06-06T00:06:15Z", "event":"SendText", "To":"squadron", "Message":"I've been thinking about it. But like, trying to gauge if it is worth it, or if I should just jump over in the caspian", "Sent":true }
{ "timestamp":"2026-06-06T00:06:36Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"nue2y", "Message":"better to go with a caspian if youre solo, but if youre trying to take two friends along, then carrier is A LOT better, esp if yall get to take ALL of your ships along", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2026-06-06T00:06:55Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"nue2y", "Message":"i heard someone say that it can be done with a single carrier tank, one-way at least", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2026-06-06T00:06:57Z", "event":"SendText", "To":"squadron", "Message":" I guess if you are going to be out there for a good while then its worth it", "Sent":true }
{ "timestamp":"2026-06-06T00:07:30Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"nue2y", "Message":"well, unlock all worthwhile odyssey engis and up them to g5", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2026-06-06T00:07:40Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"nue2y", "Message":"it wont be a one-day thing definitely", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2026-06-06T00:08:07Z", "event":"SendText", "To":"squadron", "Message":"i think it's like +/-5000t of Tritium", "Sent":true }
{ "timestamp":"2026-06-06T00:09:56Z", "event":"SendText", "To":"squadron", "Message":"say like +/-44 jumps at +/-100 trit, depends on load and stuff", "Sent":true }
{ "timestamp":"2026-06-06T00:10:16Z", "event":"ReceiveText", "From":"nue2y", "Message":"calculator says 5260 for 21kLy. not an issue if you bring a tank + cargo", "Channel":"squadron" }
{ "timestamp":"2026-06-06T00:11:09Z", "event":"SendText", "To":"squadron", "Message":"yeah, more or less. but, if I was goona jump i'd make damn sure to have a bit of spare gas - imagine having to haul trit in the black to fill up the tank sounds like the worst possible thing i can imagine", "Sent":true }
{ "timestamp":"2026-06-06T00:11:25Z", "event":"SendText", "To":"squadron", "Message":"the thought makes me shudder", "Sent":true }
